{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "1544852c3a627c78ba7fddd5076db915d26925e4962a5dcc00edc94d40ae8ddb", "ja": "夢", "zh": "梦想", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f47cc48f6d171df4b2855805ddc531848726628ef834448e9b721c4eac7a5d31", "ja": "公演メンバーを労う夜の中打ち上げ。\n各々がライブの感想を話し合う中、\n春香はオールスターライブで見た景色を\n通じてみつけた、飛び込んでいきたい夢\nを語るのだった。", "zh": "晚间，在慰劳公演成员的庆功宴上，\n众人诉说着演唱会感想时，\n春香表示在群星演唱会上看见的景象，\n让她找到了由衷想追寻的新梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "48ba4541a62f6cf3e5070780c35c36a4dfacd6b05efce437b4da35469f9e8a37", "ja": "（13人が力を合わせたオールスターライブは、\nその名に恥じない、最高のステージとなった！）", "zh": "（13人携手完成的群星演唱会，\n名符其实是场最棒的表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c030503585bb1a55555dbd98cb52cde2a5b79d2ded05a92ad284fac0dd8aa0b8", "ja": "（本当によくやってくれたな、皆！　とりあえずの\n中打ち上げで、皆のことを目一杯労ろう！）", "zh": "（各位的表现真的很棒！\n就在庆功宴上好好慰劳大家吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "fda680bdf6b48f040b4dd92717c86d1930fcf0e06e4ec5217cddf9e9fcc87e7f", "ja": "どうだった、未来、静香！\n自分達のカンペキ過ぎるライブは！", "zh": "未来、静香！怎么样？\n我们这超完美的演唱会如何！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "e04e53c11ccd08c4c650086b272cae0cd44c1e1d2f9be66d136e1989fd3eb7f6", "ja": "すっごく、すーっごくカンペキなライブでした♪\n歌もダンスもとってもカッコよかったです！", "zh": "这场演唱会真的是超级、超～级完美♪\n歌曲和舞蹈都超帅气的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "31f2cfadb668223c93e03e125775060a1275a23c2fa41f1af8b52ea3fb508548", "ja": "本当に勉強になるステージでした。\nさすが、先輩達ですね！", "zh": "这场表演真的让人获益良多，\n真不愧是前辈们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "8d21c4732728f1cc8e5700c95871e7902a255806eef69f07a17d5153ccf6c706", "ja": "そうでしょそうでしょっ！\nねぇ、自分に憧れたりした！？", "zh": "对吧对吧！\n欸，有没有很崇拜本人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "de32e8b10677512eb70ae3ce6446b0e815105490420b2d2c29f3a6fda5ec4792", "ja": "は、はい、もちろんです！", "zh": "当、当然有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "8cfc0e623f91abeeb360ae5a3b23093db747aae52a99cbcc64a80d2fe4179ea4", "ja": "ふふんっ！　やっぱり自分は、\nアイドルとしてもセンパイとしてもカンペキさーっ！", "zh": "哼哼！\n果然本人不管身为偶像还是身为前辈，都很完美啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "245c6a066182f3df554b07c5dfaa77c0cd253c97745dad30af04bb537800c1ab", "ja": "私達も響さん達みたいなライブができるように、\nがんばります！　ね、静香ちゃん♪", "zh": "为了向响你们的精采表演看齐，\n我们也会好好努力的！对吧，小静♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "4a0010682d3a2f2f3049a4f329c7aade6a0c9812546ced044a65d5acc56a2f60", "ja": "ええ。そうね、未来！", "zh": "说得没错，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "0fb71da50d1e3405cee30d3554fe1f49a3df734aa1db4b979858570259c71fb2", "ja": "ふふっ、響ちゃんったら……。\nグスッ。", "zh": "呵呵，响真是的……\n呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "1e0e3eb45e29579cb3cb8f03e3059477997e3eb61fc51d51a956b4cecd45baf6", "ja": "あっ、いたいた！\n小鳥さん、開演前は、遅刻しちゃってごめんなさい！", "zh": "啊，找到了！\n小鸟姊，对不起，我们在开演前迟到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "0d2862806bf7c9413f9309a20d23c5cffda22f515cb9abc3c845e50d0d2cdf19", "ja": "春香ちゃん、千早ちゃん！\nううっ、ぐすっ、よよよよよよ～っ！", "zh": "春香、千早！\n呜呜、呜唷唷唷唷唷唷～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "6b7ff14c45cc0689c047df44d6f7fe502ca6ca692a23e60a9bca5f5ed6023da5", "ja": "わわっ！？\nど、どうしたんですか！？", "zh": "哇哇！？\n发、发生什么事了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "16dfb81c4e3167fa573c2f9abf9c1ecdbc631f414df680e8ed40ff6b6f0eb70f", "ja": "やだ、私ったら……ごめんなさいね。\n2人の顔を見たら、なんだか感極まっちゃって……。", "zh": "讨厌，我真是的……对不起，\n一看到你们两个，就突然感动得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "63ba176e6b8fcbe220f14d2566189a0935ffa3ad7a1a86b9a87a7a260412d794", "ja": "じつは影ナレしてる間から、涙が止まらなかったの。\n本当にみんな、立派になったわね！", "zh": "其实在后台广播时我的眼泪就已经停不下来了，\n大家真的都长大了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1016_president", "source_sha256": "41d6c6a2e16a2c983e48d884eb5e60811ebce1d678ec9fdbd97470bc25439713", "ja": "うむ。音無君もアイドル諸君とともに、\n765プロをずっと支えてきてくれたからね。", "zh": "嗯嗯，\n因为一直以来音无都和偶像们一起支撑着765艺能呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1017_president", "source_sha256": "d02fa66b4868b92d8bd13cb5ccc7c6cb803b0e07eaf9c4e98a2231969e9eaf8e", "ja": "『765PRO ALLSTARS』の集大成でもある\nオールスターライブは、さぞ感慨深いものだったろう。", "zh": "在『765PRO ALLSTARS』集大成演出的群星演唱会上，\n想必感触很深吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1018_president", "source_sha256": "8a7c20578aff5ed0979d4b4f9839652629af38a5f0f5217c1fc00f1d82a2f897", "ja": "かくいう私も、実に感動したよ！\n天海君、如月君、それに君！　よくやってくれたね！", "zh": "其实我也非常感动！\n天海、如月，还有你！表现得太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "ad7043d5f974c6e799adb28c59055305c91b3d778ae70f3bd879401fcb373097", "ja": "えへへ……。社長から直接ほめられるなんて\nあんまりないですよね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……竟然直接被社长称赞，\n好难得喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "b1502f7da531d10d8b69d846c965ca8d3da92ad26fe1c6bd9b3ced10436a2e7d", "ja": "ありがとうございます、社長、音無さん。\n私も……嬉しいです。", "zh": "谢谢你们，社长、音无姊。\n我也……觉得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "8b5722d2ddae5cb9c62e7b1c3372744b9dc47d9fb28697f82e837d34de1cf35a", "ja": "私、765プロの事務員で本当によかったなぁ。\nいつも元気や勇気を、たくさんもらえて……。", "zh": "我好庆幸自己是765艺能的事务员喔～\n总是得到许多活力和勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "43ad84088a1cb31ec038bb11efb00a5eb3078b2ec16fa6e68f8da5c69bd3b3ca", "ja": "これからも全力でサポートするから、\nよろしくね、春香ちゃん、千早ちゃん！", "zh": "我以后也会继续全力支援大家的，\n请多指教啰，春香、千早！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "f531698acedfdb67a1bd435d12e8013950e22c0901ef121b0a9f621e2e34089e", "ja": "こちらこそ、\nよろしくおねがいしますね、小鳥さん！", "zh": "我们才要请你多多指教，小鸟姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1024_president", "source_sha256": "81ac6c82dbed8d199be1eff3671f09dc8d3873052c92ebfb411517cd54bbaaf6", "ja": "それでは、改めて、オールスターライブご苦労さま！\n引き続き、打ち上げを楽しんでくれたまえ！", "zh": "那么正式说一次，群星演唱会辛苦了！\n各位继续享受庆功宴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1025_001har", "source_sha256": "f794a0ee26d7f3eae335685a310904745912c654296ddef6842652fd9a5c3c0c", "ja": "えへへ。社長と小鳥さんにも\nライブ喜んでもらえて良かった♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了，\n社长和小鸟姊都喜欢这场演唱会♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "06d7ae5289d6cdd42f0c7e2cdf6c124a3642771299eed88f8d86eeda6b710ea4", "ja": "ええ、そうね。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6142d746f8ac09022d42c2c9554f80e80c325f5b4113decbabfbfe0ef74461db", "ja": "オールスターライブは、\nファンからの反響も凄かったな。", "zh": "粉丝对群星演唱会的回响也十分热烈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "12de157d524503367570e935adc4303e4f227cc83b7b3e70b5e089dfdb84394e", "ja": "……それだけ、前を向いて歌うことができた、\nということかもしれません。", "zh": "……这些或许就是\n让我们一路前进、继续歌唱的动力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1029_002chi", "source_sha256": "5a8e5401b4dfb3016fa08ed2194ad563f71e68850f850753e2a7e93251e3c762", "ja": "私達自身が顔を上げて、心からステージを楽しむ気持ち\n……それが客席にも伝わったのかと。", "zh": "我们自己抬头挺胸，打从心底享受表演的心情……\n应该也传达给观众了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "e061dda3f78284c19662274d46e61dd67f2a0f6fd2b4ea4528101192dccb26a1", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私が、今回の\n公演の準備が始まる前に言ったこと、覚えてますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你还记得我在公演准备即将开始前说过的话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "bc3438aa47a7cd3569ce1c8c163e52a4c2e37fc656c4c3e598019fb0856b0137", "ja": "これからも先頭に立って、自分の夢に向かって、\nどんどん飛び込んでいきたいって。", "zh": "我说我们以后也要继续站在最前方，\n继续勇敢追寻自己的梦想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1032_p", "source_sha256": "b161cc4cc8b837a4632f52c0fed4aed61be86fa63d7daca1178204b574766a56", "ja": "ああ。もちろん覚えてるよ。", "zh": "嗯，当然记得。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0087_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0087_story_07_1033_001har", "source_sha256": "ce5039fe49b546cca5e8072960256056024da5d0a1ee1b198f39ee9cb6bfa244", "ja": "この劇場で、『765PRO ALLSTARS』のみんなと\n一緒に、お客さんの声援に包まれていたら……。", "zh": "在这座剧场，和『765PRO ALLSTARS』的所有成员\n一起置身在观众的加油声之中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
